{
  "id": 71452336,
  "iid": 337,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "packet-gsm_sim: update to add additional EFs and ADF for 5G",
  "description": "\nModified GSM SIM card dissector to add additional EFs & ADFs as per [3GPP 31.102](https://portal.3gpp.org/desktopmodules/Specifications/SpecificationDetails.aspx?specificationId=1803) (v16.4.0) \n\nSpecifically has been updated to include all missing ADFs, all EFs under USIM (That don't already exist under DF.GSM), and all EFs under 5GS ADF.\n\nAdded additional INS (Instruction codes) from ETSI TS 102 222 for Creating/Deleting files.",
  "state": "merged",
