          "id": 415453007,
          "type": null,
          "body": "added 6 commits\n\n<ul><li>f0e7a98e - 1 commit from branch <code>wireshark:master</code></li><li>ee31292d - Added list of additional EFs and ADFs and populated 5GS ADF EFs</li><li>eb66084a - Removed 5G DF EFs for testing</li><li>4584652f - Added TS 102 222 commands</li><li>7c2a0a7c - added decoders for EFs under ADF 5GS</li><li>8c9e2803 - Added recently added EFs for 5GS</li></ul>\n\n[Compare with previous version](/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/337/diffs?diff_id=113123713&start_sha=281668fce3062d144ee8f9b1af691eb942e3e547)",
